(begin-tx "VST-I6 — INFO_VST|Merge quote vs measured charge")
(env-gasmodel "table")(env-gaslimit 100000000)(env-gas 0)
(namespace "ouronet-ns")
(print "--- [VST-I6 · 01 · merge two sleeping nonces into one] ---")
;;FUNCTION COVERAGE (G6) — `INFO_VST|Merge`, per the owner's spec. Rationale for measuring rather than
;;statically checking this family is written out at <<VST-I3>>: the `URCi_` a VST preview quotes is an
;;AGGREGATE over the legs the exec bills, so preview and exec name different functions BY DESIGN and
;;only the scales can say whether they agree.
